@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:5173
@cookie = operaon_session=SUBSTITUIR_LOCALMENTE
@lead = SUBSTITUIR_ID
@appointment = SUBSTITUIR_ID

### Criar compromisso ligado ao lead (RN-13), sem depender do Google (RN-11)
POST {{base}}/appointments
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lead_id":"{{lead}}","titulo":"Conversa fictícia","start_time":"2030-10-18T15:00:00Z","end_time":"2030-10-18T16:00:00Z"}

### Estado de sync e lembretes; ERROR após 24h de falha, reautorização fica PENDING
GET {{base}}/appointments
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Retry manual inicia nova janela e invalida jobs da geração anterior (D11)
POST {{base}}/appointments/{{appointment}}/retry
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Perda cancela compromissos futuros (D25/RN-16)
PATCH {{base}}/leads/{{lead}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"etapa":"PERDIDO","motivo_perda":"TIMING"}
